Fingers trembling, he brushes one gloved hand across the smooth &+Wbone&N and pulls
back as though it burned him.

&+C'My gods!' &Nhe whispers. The usual theatrical mirth, forced jester's grin, and
flamboyant bravado - everything falls away like shattered glass.

&+CYou... killed him!' his voice cracks, but not weakly, with the weight of
decades of grief, fury, and obsession finally losing their anchor.

&+C'Not a projection. Not an echo. Not one of the illusions he spins across the valley
&+Clike a spider's web..' &nhe gasps a sharp breath, eyes widening as he studies
the &+Wskull's &Nshape, the fanged jaw.

&+C'So it was true. His vulnerable form, in his crypt. The one place he can
&+Ctruly be undone.' he says, covering his mouth with shaking fingers.
&+C'By the Morninglord, by every power that ever turned its face from this
&+Cdamned valley.. it's done.'
